ests, I get the dead Chrome page as shown below.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"925\" alt=\"screen shot 2017-05-05 at 12 47 49 pm\" src=\"https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1271364/25755490/39e78e4a-3191-11e7-8e79-91155843fbea.png\">\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior:\r\nBefore 0.19.2, when I edited my `cypress.json` file, Cypress would close my current browser running tests. To be honest, this was never really an ideal solution either, but it did save me from having to manually go out and Stop my browser in Cypress and restart it. \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"RandallKent","id":51821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent","html_url":"https://github.com/RandallKent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandallKent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/492/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/492/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}